  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001",
      "title": "Molehat 装备标签到夜视表现、耗尽退出与正燃料恢复的有限链",
      "aliases": [
        "molehat",
        "鼹鼠帽夜视",
        "装备效果完整链",
        "nightvision",
        "PlayerVision:HasNightVision"
      ],
      "engineering_question": "HEAD 装备怎样经复制装备表产生实际夜视，卸下、替换和耗尽怎样撤销，本帽补料与正燃料读档怎样恢复？",
      "knowledge_status": "research",
      "retrieval_status": "restricted",
      "coding_status": "hold",
      "scope": {
        "source_epoch": "762172",
        "runtime_verified": false,
        "evidence": "authorized_frozen_archive_static_lua",
        "object": "molehat",
        "bounds": [
          "普通 Equippable HEAD 与 Inventory 成员路径，正燃料正常创建/保存记录。",
          "视野链止于 PostProcessor 与 TheSim 的原生表现调用。",
          "复用 EXP-ITEM-004、EXP-GEAR-001、EXP-LIFE-001、EXP-LIFE-006、EXP-LIFE-008 的既有合同。"
        ],
        "exclusions": [
          "死亡掉落模式、换角、玩家session外部读写、跨分片、全部帽子及第三方覆盖。",
          "异常零燃料存活记录的产品修复政策。",
          "真实网络送达、颜色纹理呈现与原生内部实现。"
        ]
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001-C01",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "molehat 的 simple(mole_custom_init) 在 SetPristine 前建立 nightvision 标签，HEAD Equippable 与 WORMLIGHT Fueled 位于 master 分支。mole_onequip 经通用帽子回调开始消费并播放开启声，卸下经通用回调停止消费并播放关闭声，装备到模型的通用回调停止消费。实际夜视由装备表中标签的查询派生。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EQ-HAT-CONSTRUCT",
            "EQ-HAT-BASE",
            "EQ-HAT-MODEL",
            "EQ-MOLE",
            "EQ-INV-TAGS"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001-C02",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "服务器 Inventory 提交装备槽后发布 equip，卸下清槽后发布 unequip；inventory replica 在 master 将事件转给 classified:SetSlotEquip，后者设置装备 net_entity。客户端 RegisterNetListeners 为装备 dirty 安排 static 任务，OnEquipsDirty 发布玩家 equip/unequip 并 QueueRefresh。replica:EquipHasTag 在有主组件时查主组件，否则扫描 classified:GetEquips 的当前预览或网络表。原生 net_entity 传送与代理刷新时序保留边界。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EQ-INV-EQUIP-COMMIT",
            "EQ-INV-UNEQUIP",
            "EQ-REPLICA-BRIDGE",
            "EQ-CLASSIFIED-SET",
            "EQ-CLASSIFIED-NET",
            "EQ-CLASSIFIED-DIRTY",
            "EQ-CLASSIFIED-LISTEN",
            "EQ-CLASSIFIED-GET",
            "EQ-REPLICA-TAGS"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001-C03",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "PlayerCommon 在 master 早退之前安装 playervision。PlayerVision 构造安排零延迟 OnInit，登记 equip/unequip；客户端还登记 inventoryclosed，并在 replica 可用时立即查询当前装备标签。OnEquipChanged 更新自身 nightvision；forcenightvision 未开启时重算色表并发布 nightvision。HasNightVision 返回 nightvision or forcenightvision，因此移走本帽后仍按其他标签装备及强制夜视状态得到结果。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EQ-PLAYER-VISION",
            "EQ-PLAYER-MASTER",
            "EQ-VISION-INIT",
            "EQ-VISION-CC",
            "EQ-REPLICA-TAGS",
            "EQ-CLASSIFIED-GET"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001-C04",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "PlayerVision:UpdateCCTable 按 ghostvision、overridecctable、允许色表的装备或强制夜视、nightmarevision 顺序选当前色表，变化时发布 ccoverrides 与 ccphasefn。colourcube 对激活玩家登记这两个事件，激活时读取当前快照，沿 UpdateAmbientCCTable/Blend 到 PostProcessor:SetColourCubeData/SetColourCubeLerp。ambientlighting 对激活玩家的 nightvision 登记监听，激活时通过 CanEntitySeeInDark 初始化，沿 OnNightVision 到 TheSim:SetVisualAmbientColour；这些原生调用是本条可追溯的最终表现边界。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EQ-VISION-INIT",
            "EQ-VISION-CC",
            "EQ-CC-EVENT",
            "EQ-CC-ACTIVE",
            "EQ-CC-BLEND",
            "EQ-CC-UPDATE",
            "EQ-AMBIENT",
            "EQ-AMBIENT-ACTIVE",
            "EQ-DARK-QUERY"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "mole_perish 在仍装备且有 owner 时先播放关闭声，再 Remove 帽子。InventoryItem:OnRemoveEntity 对 owner Inventory 调 RemoveItem(self.inst,true)，装备成员路径 force Unequip，先回调停止消费，再清槽和发布 unequip，夜视消费者据当前剩余标签重算。耗尽回调与卸下回调各有关闭声入口，观察声音不能预设每次耗尽恰好一次。实体全链清理责任复用 EXP-LIFE-008，周期句柄责任复用 EXP-LIFE-006。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EQ-MOLE",
            "EQ-HAT-BASE",
            "EQ-ITEM-REMOVE",
            "EQ-INV-REMOVE",
            "EQ-INV-UNEQUIP",
            "EQ-VISION-INIT",
            "EQ-FUEL-CONSUME"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001-C06",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "正常尚存 molehat 可由接受 WORMLIGHT 的 Fueled 补充容量，耗尽政策删除实体。Fueled 保存非满 fuel 数值，加载以 InitializeFuelLevel 恢复；Inventory 保存持久装备的 GetSaveRecord，并在 OnLoad 对 SpawnSaveRecord 结果重新 Equip。由这条普通恢复路径，正燃料装备重新经过本帽装备回调恢复消费，PlayerVision 以初始化查询/装备变化派生视野。该条只声明普通 Inventory 保存入口，玩家 session 的外部读写调度另留待验。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EQ-MOLE",
            "EQ-FUEL-ACCEPT",
            "EQ-FUEL-SAVE",
            "EQ-FUEL-CONSUME",
            "EQ-INV-SAVE",
            "EQ-INV-LOAD",
            "EQ-VISION-INIT"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-CHAIN-GEAR-001-C07",
          "kind": "EI",
          "statement": "正常耗尽删除路径中的 molehat 不留下可继续补料的空壳。若外部构造 fuel=0 的存活记录，OnLoad 的初始化不会重放 depleted；随后 Equip 可建立 nightvision 标签效果，而 DoUpdate 在空段位未改变时只停止消费，不能据这条链承诺自动删除该异常空物。此输入需由项目自行决定接收或修复政策，本条有限闭包限正常创建与正燃料保存记录。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "EQ-MOLE",
            "EQ-FUEL-SAVE",
            "EQ-FUEL-CONSUME",
            "EQ-INV-LOAD",
            "EQ-VISION-INIT"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "api_contracts": [
        {
